{{physical}}{{/ˈfɪzɪkl}}{{adj. 身体的；物理的}}{{Physical exercise is important for health.}}
{{platform}}{{/ˈplætfɔːm}}{{n. 平台；站台}}{{The train arrived at platform 3.}}
{{pledge}}{{/pledʒ}}{{n./v. 誓言；保证}}{{He pledged to donate half of his wealth to charity.}}
{{policy}}{{/ˈpɒləsi}}{{n. 政策；方针}}{{The government introduced a new education policy.}}
{{political}}{{/pəˈlɪtɪkl}}{{adj. 政治的}}{{Political stability is essential for economic growth.}}
{{popular}}{{/ˈpɒpjələr}}{{adj. 受欢迎的；流行的}}{{The song became very popular among young people.}}
{{pose}}{{/pəʊz}}{{v./n. 摆姿势；造成；姿态}}{{The new policy poses a challenge for small businesses.}}
{{positive}}{{/ˈpɒzətɪv}}{{adj. 积极的；肯定的}}{{A positive attitude can lead to success.}}
{{potential}}{{/pəˈtenʃl}}{{adj./n. 潜在的；潜力}}{{She has the potential to become a great scientist.}}
