{{premise}}{{/ˈpremɪs}}{{n. 前提；房屋}}{{The argument is based on a false premise.}}
{{preserve}}{{/prɪˈzɜːv}}{{v. 保护；保存；保持}}{{We must preserve our cultural heritage.}}
{{prestige}}{{/preˈstiːʒ}}{{n. 威望；声望}}{{The university enjoys international prestige.}}
