{{pursue}}{{/pəˈsjuː}}{{v. 追求；追赶；从事}}{{She pursued a career in medicine.}}
{{qualify}}{{/ˈkwɒlɪfaɪ}}{{v. 使合格；具有资格}}{{Her experience qualifies her for the position.}}
{{radical}}{{/ˈrædɪkl}}{{adj./n. 激进的；根本的}}{{The government introduced radical reforms.}}
{{random}}{{/ˈrændəm}}{{adj. 随机的；任意的}}{{The numbers were selected at random.}}
{{range}}{{/reɪndʒ}}{{n./v. 范围；山脉；排列}}{{The store offers a wide range of products.}}
{{rank}}{{/ræŋk}}{{n./v. 等级；排名}}{{The university ranks among the top 10 in the world.}}
